  "description": "Flyway C GRX 610 is a carbon gravel bike built around comfort, stability, and versatility. Its carbon fiber frame features our Class 5 VRS™ design to reduce road chatter. The geometry puts you in a comfortable, confident riding position that’s well suited to lining up on race day or taking the day off to roam. Flyway’s cargo versatility gives you plenty of places on the frame and fork to stow your ride essentials, no matter how long you’re planning to be out there. The Shimano GRX 610 components are a gravel standard that won’t let you down on the ups and downs of your route.",
